_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af61o1D1o40gWT3mRrwJ3ecr3Jm7rwXXjs6nwjRjwBMFUg&oe=69FC9D88"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Commmando Strike Ops : Gun Shooting VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Experience the ultimate VR military combat where you become an elite special forces operative. Face intelligent enemies that hunt, flank, and coordinate attacks in intense mission-based operations. Your survival depends on quick reflexes and strategic thinking in this immersive tactical FPS.\n\nFeel your heart race as enemies close in from all directions, using advanced tactics to surround your position. The immersive VR environment puts you right in the action - feel the virtual weapon in your hands, hear enemy communications echo through your surroundings, and experience the tension of combat where every decision matters.\n\nKey Features:\n- Advanced AI enemies that actively hunt and outmaneuver you\n- Deep weapon customization with large decals and tactical attachments\n- Mission-based operations across diverse combat environments\n- Physical VR interactions for reloading and aiming\n- Realistic military simulation with authentic combat mechanics\n- Progressive challenge system that tests your skills\n- Multiple engagement styles from stealth to all-out assault\n\nCustomize your arsenal with red laser sights for precision targeting and extended magazines to maintain firepower during intense engagements. Each mission delivers heart-pounding action as you fight through urban warfare zones, secure hostile territories, and defend strategic positions against overwhelming odds.\n\nLock, load, and enter the most immersive VR combat experience available today. The battlefield awaits your command", "short_description": "Step into the boots of an elite operative in Commando Strike Ops, a groundbreaking tactical FPS designed. This immersive Military Sim challenges you with intense Mission-Based combat against ruthless enemies who will stop at nothing. Customize your weapons with Large Decals & red laser sight. Outsmart & outshoot these relentless enemies in desperate fight for survival where every decision carries weight. This is the definitive Action VR Shooter experience\u2014where your skill decides mission's fate."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/ksgamestudio/privacy-policy-meta", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "KSGameStudio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/ksgamestudio/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "32267209189592925"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 7, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1459235629263524"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "26440803735572463"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1640881380698769"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1384891586192800"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "900706905712498"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1606282627193221"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2104776870262820"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1640881380698769"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1779123600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1459235629263524"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "And